From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 13:43:40 -0647
Subject: [PATCH] pinctrl: samsung: zumapro: accept wake requests on the
 wake-up EINTs

The google,zumapro-wakeup-eint chip has no irq_set_wake, so a
wake-enabled consumer such as gpio-keys fails its suspend callback with
-ENXIO ("failed to configure IRQ 47 as wakeup source: -6" on the Pixel
9a) and the whole suspend aborts.

The wake-up EINTs are chained on GIC SPIs, which suspend_device_irqs()
leaves enabled, so for s2idle the pin only has to stay unmasked: reuse
gs101_wkup_irq_set_wake(), which records the request and writes no PMU
register. The G4 PMU system-wakeup masks remain unimplemented, and the
comment says so.

Signed-off-by: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/pinctrl/samsung/pinctrl-exynos.c | 8 +++++++-
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/pinctrl/samsung/pinctrl-exynos.c b/drivers/pinctrl/samsung/pinctrl-exynos.c
index eae185d85..959cf0a2e 100644
--- a/drivers/pinctrl/samsung/pinctrl-exynos.c
+++ b/drivers/pinctrl/samsung/pinctrl-exynos.c
@@ -673,7 +673,12 @@ static const struct exynos_irq_chip gs101_wkup_irq_chip __initconst = {
 	.set_eint_wakeup_mask = gs101_pinctrl_set_eint_wakeup_mask,
 };
 
-/* Runtime EINT handling only; G4 system-wakeup masks are not implemented. */
+/*
+ * Runtime EINT handling and s2idle wake: the wake-up EINTs are chained
+ * on GIC SPIs that stay enabled through s2idle, so a wake-enabled pin
+ * only has to stay unmasked. The G4 PMU system-wakeup masks are not
+ * implemented, so deeper system sleep states cannot wake from these pins.
+ */
 static const struct exynos_irq_chip zumapro_wkup_irq_chip __initconst = {
 	.chip = {
 		.name = "zumapro_wkup_irq_chip",
@@ -681,6 +686,7 @@ static const struct exynos_irq_chip zumapro_wkup_irq_chip __initconst = {
 		.irq_mask = exynos_irq_mask,
 		.irq_ack = exynos_irq_ack,
 		.irq_set_type = exynos_irq_set_type,
+		.irq_set_wake = gs101_wkup_irq_set_wake,
 		.irq_request_resources = exynos_irq_request_resources,
 		.irq_release_resources = exynos_irq_release_resources,
 	},
